  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.0,
      "text": "This is a chart of the wealth of every single American household.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108389,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.065491
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 5.0,
      "end": 14.1,
      "text": "That includes cars, houses, yachts, jewelry, and even cold hard cash.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108389,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.065491
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 14.1,
      "end": 18.1,
      "text": "It also includes things we owe other people, like student loans.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108389,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.065491
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 18.1,
      "end": 23.77,
      "text": "So let's take a quick tour of American household wealth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108389,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.065491
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 23.77,
      "end": 27.77,
      "text": "We can start over here, where we see people who owe way more than they have.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108389,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.065491
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 27.77,
      "end": 32.77,
      "text": "As we move further right, we can see, oh, that's me.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108389,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.065491
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 32.77,
      "end": 37.77,
      "text": "And there's my doctor, who owns an expensive home.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07963,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 37.77,
      "end": 40.77,
      "text": "And there's four more heavyweight boxer Mike Tyson.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07963,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 40.77,
      "end": 45.77,
      "text": "But when we get to the very richest people in the world, oh hey, it's Beyonce.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07963,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 45.77,
      "end": 51.77,
      "text": "We can zoom out so far that this chart looks like a stick, and we still can't see the top of their wealth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07963,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 51.77,
      "end": 56.77,
      "text": "Because these people are so much wealthier than the rest of us.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07963,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 56.77,
      "end": 59.77,
      "text": "In other words, this chart doesn't just show wealth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07963,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00141
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 59.77,
      "end": 63.77,
      "text": "It shows the staggering wealth inequality we have in America.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.050379,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003824
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 63.77,
      "end": 70.77,
      "text": "But recently, politicians have been talking about an idea that's never been done before in America.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.050379,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003824
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 70.77,
      "end": 78.7,
      "text": "To even out wealth, we should tax it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.050379,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003824
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 78.7,
      "end": 82.7,
      "text": "In January, Senator Elizabeth Warren proposed something called a wealth tax.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.050379,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003824
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 82.7,
      "end": 84.7,
      "text": "This was a big deal.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.050379,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003824
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 84.7,
      "end": 89.7,
      "text": "Because this doesn't typically get taxed.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.050379,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003824
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 89.7,
      "end": 93.7,
      "text": "Most of the taxes we pay only happen when money changes hands.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.050379,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003824
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 93.7,
      "end": 97.7,
      "text": "Like when we earn money, or spend money.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.070699,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005554
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 97.7,
      "end": 101.7,
      "text": "But according to Warren, here's the problem with that.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.070699,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005554
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 101.7,
      "end": 105.7,
      "text": "This bar represents my wealth, and this is my friend's wealth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.070699,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005554
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 105.7,
      "end": 106.7,
      "text": "I think he owns a yacht.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.070699,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005554
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 106.7,
      "end": 112.7,
      "text": "But because both of us have the same job and earn about the same amount of money, our income gets taxed about the same.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.070699,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005554
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 112.7,
      "end": 119.7,
      "text": "Two people who may have the same income, but are in wildly different economic circumstances.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.070699,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005554
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 119.7,
      "end": 124.7,
      "text": "So to fix it, Warren wants to tax the actual wealth people have.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.058319
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 124.7,
      "end": 127.7,
      "text": "But only for the very, very rich.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.058319
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 127.7,
      "end": 129.7,
      "text": "Here's your proposal.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.058319
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 129.7,
      "end": 136.7,
      "text": "All the wealth above this line, $50 million, would be taxed at 2% each year.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.058319
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 136.7,
      "end": 141.7,
      "text": "All the wealth above this line, $1 billion, would be taxed at 3%.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.058319
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 141.7,
      "end": 145.7,
      "text": "So if you have $40 million, you'd pay nothing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087911,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.058319
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 145.7,
      "end": 154.7,
      "text": "If you have $60 million, you'd pay nothing on your first $50 million, but 2% on the $10 million after that.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075592,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004753
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 154.7,
      "end": 156.7,
      "text": "Or $200,000.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075592,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004753
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 156.7,
      "end": 163.7,
      "text": "And if you have $2 billion, you'd pay about $49 million.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075592,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004753
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 163.7,
      "end": 167.7,
      "text": "So what would happen if we imposed Senator Warren's tax?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075592,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004753
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 167.7,
      "end": 171.7,
      "text": "Well, only the richest 0.05% of Americans would pay this tax.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.075592,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004753
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 171.7,
      "end": 176.7,
      "text": "But in 2016, the government could have raised about $200 billion from it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058513,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.069519
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 176.7,
      "end": 181.7,
      "text": "That could pay for a plan that makes public college tuition free three times over.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058513,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.069519
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 181.7,
      "end": 187.7,
      "text": "It could pay for all federal food assistance programs like food stamps two times over.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058513,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.069519
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 187.7,
      "end": 191.7,
      "text": "It could get close to cutting child poverty by 60%.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058513,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.069519
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 191.7,
      "end": 195.7,
      "text": "These are massive programs that would help millions of people.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058513,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.069519
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 195.7,
      "end": 200.7,
      "text": "And what makes that possible is the huge amount of wealth stuck here",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058513,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.069519
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 200.7,
      "end": 204.7,
      "text": "at the very, very top with the ultra-rich.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.101863,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.063599
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 204.7,
      "end": 210.48,
      "text": "A wealth tax hones in on that.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.101863,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.063599
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:16:59+0800"
